Description: Provides measures of effect sizes for summarized continuous
    variables as well as diagnostic accuracy statistics for 2x2 table data.
    Includes functions for Cohen's d, robust effect size, Cohen's q,
    partial eta-squared, coefficient of variation, odds ratio, likelihood
    ratios, sensitivity, specificity, positive and negative predictive
    values, Youden index, number needed to treat, number needed to diagnose,
    and predictive summary index.
